---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Ecstatic Grooves — Danza consapevole a Bologna">
<div class="hero">
    <video class="hero-vid" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%201600%20900%22%20preserveAspectRatio%3D%22xMidYMid%20slice%22%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3CradialGradient%20id%3D%22r%22%20cx%3D%2255%25%22%20cy%3D%2242%25%22%20r%3D%2285%25%22%3E%3Cstop%20offset%3D%220%22%20stop-color%3D%22%236A2AE8%22%2F%3E%3Cstop%20offset%3D%22.55%22%20stop-color%3D%22%233C168E%22%2F%3E%3Cstop%20offset%3D%221%22%20stop-color%3D%22%23160A2E%22%2F%3E%3C%2FradialGradient%3E%3C%2Fdefs%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%221600%22%20height%3D%22900%22%20fill%3D%22url%28%2523r%29%22%2F%3E%3Cg%20stroke%3D%22%23ffffff%22%20stroke-opacity%3D%220.14%22%20stroke-width%3D%222.5%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M-40%20640%20C400%20520%20800%20760%201660%20560%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M-40%20720%20C500%20620%20900%20820%201660%20680%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M-40%20560%20C400%20470%20800%20620%201660%20480%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%3Cg%20fill%3D%22%23ffffff%22%20fill-opacity%3D%220.13%22%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%22820%22%20cy%3D%22360%22%20r%3D%2246%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M820%20406%20C784%20436%20792%20540%20766%20620%20L800%20620%20C812%20566%20828%20566%20840%20620%20L874%20620%20C848%20540%20856%20436%20820%20406%20Z%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E">
      <source src="https://assets.mixkit.co/videos/33899/33899-360.mp4" type="video/mp4">
    </video>
    <div class="hero-scrim"></div>
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-it="Ecstatic Dance · Bologna" data-en="Ecstatic Dance · Bologna">Ecstatic Dance · Bologna</p>
      <h1 data-it="Pensa meno, <span class='serif-i'>balla di più.</span>" data-en="Think less, <span class='serif-i'>dance more.</span>">Pensa meno, <span class="serif-i">balla di più.</span></h1>
      <p class="sub" data-it="Non serve saper ballare: arriva come sei e riparti più leggerə ed energicə. Un sabato sera al mese a Bologna, uno spazio sicuro per spegnere la mente e muoverti esattamente come ti senti. Vieni da solə o porta degli amici, qui sono tuttə benvenutə." data-en="You don't need to know how to dance, arrive as you are and leave lighter and energised. One Saturday evening a month in Bologna, a safe space to switch off your mind and move exactly how you feel. Come alone or bring friends, everyone's welcome here.">Non serve saper ballare: arriva come sei e riparti più leggerə ed energicə. Un sabato sera al mese a Bologna, uno spazio sicuro per spegnere la mente e muoverti esattamente come ti senti. Vieni da solə o porta degli amici, qui sono tuttə benvenutə.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-solid" href="/eventi" data-it="Biglietti" data-en="Get tickets">Biglietti</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost hero-ghost" href="/esperienza" data-it="È la tua prima volta?" data-en="First time here?">È la tua prima volta?</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="wrap two-col">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow" data-it="Cosa facciamo" data-en="What we do">Cosa facciamo</p>
        <h2 data-it="Più di una semplice danza" data-en="More than just a dance">Più di una semplice danza</h2>
        <p class="lead" style="margin:.5em 0 1em" data-it="I nostri eventi sono concepiti come un santuario per l'autoespressione e l'esplorazione attraverso il movimento. È un viaggio di scoperta di sé e di connessione con la comunità." data-en="Our events are designed as a sanctuary for self-expression and exploration through movement. It's a journey of self-discovery and communal connection.">I nostri eventi sono concepiti come un santuario per l'autoespressione e l'esplorazione attraverso il movimento. È un viaggio di scoperta di sé e di connessione con la comunità.</p>
        <p style="color:var(--ink-soft)" data-it="Creiamo spazi sicuri e inclusivi dove le persone di ogni provenienza possono tornare a sé stesse attraverso musica e movimento — dove l'autenticità è benvenuta e la danza diventa un cammino di espressione, cura e gioia condivisa." data-en="We create safe, inclusive spaces where people from all backgrounds can return to themselves through music and movement — where authenticity is welcome, and dance becomes a path to healing, expression, and shared joy.">Creiamo spazi sicuri e inclusivi dove le persone di ogni provenienza possono tornare a sé stesse attraverso musica e movimento — dove l'autenticità è benvenuta e la danza diventa un cammino di espressione, cura e gioia condivisa.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" style="margin-top:26px" href="/chi-siamo" data-it="La nostra storia" data-en="Our story">La nostra storia</a>
      </div>
      <div class="photo tall" style="background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20400%20500%22%20preserveAspectRatio%3D%22xMidYMid%20slice%22%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3ClinearGradient%20id%3D%22g%22%20x1%3D%220%22%20y1%3D%220%22%20x2%3D%221%22%20y2%3D%221%22%3E%3Cstop%20offset%3D%220%22%20stop-color%3D%22%238248E8%22%2F%3E%3Cstop%20offset%3D%22.55%22%20stop-color%3D%22%235F1CEC%22%2F%3E%3Cstop%20offset%3D%221%22%20stop-color%3D%22%23241046%22%2F%3E%3C%2FlinearGradient%3E%3C%2Fdefs%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22400%22%20height%3D%22500%22%20fill%3D%22url%28%2523g%29%22%2F%3E%3Cg%20stroke%3D%22%23ffffff%22%20stroke-opacity%3D%220.20%22%20stroke-width%3D%222%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M-20%20360%20C120%20290%20210%20420%20430%20320%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M-20%20410%20C140%20350%20250%20470%20430%20390%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M-20%20300%20C120%20250%20210%20350%20430%20260%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%3Cg%20fill%3D%22%23ffffff%22%20fill-opacity%3D%220.15%22%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%22205%22%20cy%3D%22180%22%20r%3D%2230%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M205%20212%20C182%20232%20188%20300%20172%20350%20L196%20350%20C205%20316%20212%20316%20220%20350%20L244%20350%20C230%20300%20236%20232%20205%20212%20Z%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E'),linear-gradient(140deg,#CDB4E8,#9B6FD8 55%,#5F1CEC);background-size:cover;background-position:center"><span class="lbl">Foto: un momento della serata</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block-2 alt">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head" style="max-width:none">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-it="Le voci della comunità" data-en="From our community">Le voci della comunità</p>
        <h2 data-it="Come ci si sente" data-en="How it feels">Come ci si sente</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="tgrid">
        <div class="t"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p data-it="&ldquo;One of the best days I've had in a whiiile, and it's only 2pm. Grazie a voi, the founders of Ecstatic Grooves.&rdquo;" data-en="&ldquo;One of the best days I've had in a whiiile, and it's only 2pm. Grazie a voi, the founders of Ecstatic Grooves.&rdquo;">&ldquo;One of the best days I've had in a whiiile, and it's only 2pm. Grazie a voi, the founders of Ecstatic Grooves.&rdquo;</p><div class="who" data-it="@terranknots · 02/09/2024" data-en="@terranknots · 02/09/2024">@terranknots · 02/09/2024</div></div>
        <div class="t"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p data-it="&ldquo;Thank you Holly! I can't wait to listen to your music again and repeat the experience. It was ecstatically beautiful and deeply moving.&rdquo;" data-en="&ldquo;Thank you Holly! I can't wait to listen to your music again and repeat the experience. It was ecstatically beautiful and deeply moving.&rdquo;">&ldquo;Thank you Holly! I can't wait to listen to your music again and repeat the experience. It was ecstatically beautiful and deeply moving.&rdquo;</p><div class="who" data-it="Anonimo · 02/09/2024" data-en="Anonymous · 02/09/2024">Anonimo · 02/09/2024</div></div>
        <div class="t"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p data-it="&ldquo;Thanks for bringing Ecstatic Dance to Bologna! I used to travel to Milan or Turin, which wasn't always comfortable. Can't wait for the next one, and the location was easy to reach by train and bus.&rdquo;" data-en="&ldquo;Thanks for bringing Ecstatic Dance to Bologna! I used to travel to Milan or Turin, which wasn't always comfortable. Can't wait for the next one, and the location was easy to reach by train and bus.&rdquo;">&ldquo;Thanks for bringing Ecstatic Dance to Bologna! I used to travel to Milan or Turin, which wasn't always comfortable. Can't wait for the next one, and the location was easy to reach by train and bus.&rdquo;</p><div class="who" data-it="Anonimo · 02/09/2024" data-en="Anonymous · 02/09/2024">Anonimo · 02/09/2024</div></div>
        <div class="t"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p data-it="&ldquo;I was afraid I wouldn't vibe with the 'ecstatic' music, but the playlist surprised me, especially the second part!&rdquo;" data-en="&ldquo;I was afraid I wouldn't vibe with the 'ecstatic' music, but the playlist surprised me, especially the second part!&rdquo;">&ldquo;I was afraid I wouldn't vibe with the 'ecstatic' music, but the playlist surprised me, especially the second part!&rdquo;</p><div class="who" data-it="Anonimo · 13/04/2024" data-en="Anonymous · 13/04/2024">Anonimo · 13/04/2024</div></div>
        <div class="t"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p data-it="&ldquo;Life brought me here tonight and everything felt so natural. ;)&rdquo;" data-en="&ldquo;Life brought me here tonight and everything felt so natural. ;)&rdquo;">&ldquo;Life brought me here tonight and everything felt so natural. ;)&rdquo;</p><div class="who" data-it="Anonimo · 05/11/2024" data-en="Anonymous · 05/11/2024">Anonimo · 05/11/2024</div></div>
        <div class="t"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p data-it="&ldquo;You opened a whole new world for me, thank you!&rdquo;" data-en="&ldquo;You opened a whole new world for me, thank you!&rdquo;">&ldquo;You opened a whole new world for me, thank you!&rdquo;</p><div class="who" data-it="Anonimo · 05/11/2024" data-en="Anonymous · 05/11/2024">Anonimo · 05/11/2024</div></div>
        <div class="t"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p data-it="&ldquo;Thank you for creating a space of love and freedom where connection can blossom!&rdquo;" data-en="&ldquo;Thank you for creating a space of love and freedom where connection can blossom!&rdquo;">&ldquo;Thank you for creating a space of love and freedom where connection can blossom!&rdquo;</p><div class="who" data-it="Caterina · 21/09/2024" data-en="Caterina · 21/09/2024">Caterina · 21/09/2024</div></div>
        <div class="t"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p data-it="&ldquo;Thank you Holly and Felippe for another amazing Ecstatic Dance event, love you guys.&rdquo;" data-en="&ldquo;Thank you Holly and Felippe for another amazing Ecstatic Dance event, love you guys.&rdquo;">&ldquo;Thank you Holly and Felippe for another amazing Ecstatic Dance event, love you guys.&rdquo;</p><div class="who" data-it="Anonimo" data-en="Anonymous">Anonimo</div></div>
        <div class="t"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p data-it="&ldquo;Thank you from the bottom of my heart for holding a space that allowed our souls to go through transformation and share love. We are One!&rdquo;" data-en="&ldquo;Thank you from the bottom of my heart for holding a space that allowed our souls to go through transformation and share love. We are One!&rdquo;">&ldquo;Thank you from the bottom of my heart for holding a space that allowed our souls to go through transformation and share love. We are One!&rdquo;</p><div class="who" data-it="Anonimo" data-en="Anonymous">Anonimo</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="callout">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-it="Resta nel cerchio" data-en="Stay in the circle">Resta nel cerchio</p>
        <h2 data-it="Iscriviti alla newsletter" data-en="Join our newsletter">Iscriviti alla newsletter</h2>
        <p data-it="Ricevi aggiornamenti sui prossimi eventi e sul percorso di crescita della nostra comunità. Una volta al mese, niente rumore." data-en="Updates about our upcoming events and the growth journey of our community. Once a month, no noise.">Ricevi aggiornamenti sui prossimi eventi e sul percorso di crescita della nostra comunità. Una volta al mese, niente rumore.</p>
        <div class="news"><input type="email" data-it-ph="La tua email" data-en-ph="Your email" placeholder="La tua email" aria-label="Email"><button class="btn btn-solid" onclick="fakeSub(this)" data-it="Iscriviti" data-en="Subscribe">Iscriviti</button></div>
        <p class="note" data-it="Form dimostrativo — da collegare a MailerLite / Buttondown." data-en="Demo form — connect to MailerLite / Buttondown.">Form dimostrativo — da collegare a MailerLite / Buttondown.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
